---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Terms of Use — Toolora" description="Read the terms and responsible-use guidance for Toolora's free online tools.">
  <SiteHeader backHref="/" backLabel="Home" />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Terms</div><span class="eyebrow">Using Toolora</span><h1 class="display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mt-3">Terms of Use</h1><p class="text-slate-500 mt-3 text-sm max-w-2xl">Straightforward guidance for using Toolora's free online utilities.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section"><article class="container max-w-3xl tool-panel p-6 md:p-9">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: November 24, 2026</p>
      <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold mt-7">1. Use of the service</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Toolora provides browser-based utilities for general productivity and convenience. You are responsible for the content you process and for confirming that you have the rights and permissions needed to use it.</p>
      <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold mt-7">2. Accuracy and important decisions</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Results are provided for general informational and convenience purposes. Review important outputs before relying on them. Calculators and automated checks are not professional, medical, legal, financial or security advice.</p>
      <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold mt-7">3. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Do not use Toolora to violate laws, infringe rights, distribute harmful content, interfere with the website or attempt to compromise its security or availability.</p>
      <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold mt-7">4. Availability and changes</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">Features may be improved, changed or temporarily unavailable. Toolora is provided without a guarantee that every output will be error-free or suitable for every purpose.</p>
      <h2 class="display text-2xl font-bold mt-7">5. Updates</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">These terms may change as the service develops. Continued use after an update means you should review the revised terms.</p>
    </article></section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</SiteLayout>
